window.products.push({"id":1173134,"name":"Insta 360 GO 2 Action Camera with Starter Accessory Bundle - Includes: Frame Adapter for Insta360 GO2, 3-in-1 Multi-Grip (Selfie Stick, Tripod, Grip) ","category":"electronics","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71MUsWS20qL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Add a miniature action camera for everyday applications anywhere, anytime with the Insta360 GO 2. The GO 2 improves on its predecessor by recording up to 3K 2560 x 1440 video, audio, and 9MP photos, and it also adds a slow motion recording feature. It now includes 32GB of built in flash storage, and it allows you to control the camera, preview your video, and then export the content to your phone via a companion iOS/Android app via Wi Fi. The GO 2 is so small and light, you can wear it around your neck, clip it to your collar or skateboard, attach it to your dashboard, and much more. The camera comes built into a waterproof case that lets you shoot in up to 13' of water. Also included is a Charge Case, which features a larger 1100mAh capacity battery than the original GO model to provide up to 150 minutes of recording time. Although the camera has a built in battery, the Charge Case provides an alternative power solution (and much more). Per charge, it lets you capture approximately 15 minute clips. Bundle Includes: Insta360 GO 2 Action Camera Manufacturer Accessories: Charge Case (with Lightning/Micro USB Connectors) Lens Guard Charge Cable Magnet Pendant Easy Clip Pivot Stand Additional Accessories: Action Camera Frame Adapter for Insta360 GO2 Selfie Stick 3 in 1 Action Camera Mount Multi Grip Chest Strap with Action Camera Mount Wrist Strap with Action Camera Mount Gadget Cleaning Pen Microfiber Cloth","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71MUsWS20qL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Insta 360","source_asin":"B096YK8M15","category_path":"Electronics"},"sku":"BM-1173134","productType":"Electronics","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B096YK8M15","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"electronics-range.jsonl","source_asin":"B096YK8M15","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
