window.products.push({"id":1173300,"name":"ViewSonic VP2468_H2 24-Inch Premium Dual Pack Head-Only IPS 1080p Monitors with ColorPro 100% sRGB Rec 709, 14-bit 3D LUT, Eye Care, HDMI, USB, DP Dai","category":"electronics","retail price":429.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81SYbQ6PBuL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"If you are looking for professional monitors that deliver unmatched color accuracy, as well as easy deployment and mounting capabilities, look no further than the ViewSonic VP2468_H2. Sold as a dual Pack of monitors without monitor stands, the VP2468_H2 requires less packaging for a reduced environmental footprint, while still providing compatible mounting for easy dual-screen installation. With edge-to-edge super clear IPS panels and one of the world’ s thinnest bezels, the VP2468_H2 provides A sleek and frameless viewing experience ideal for dual-monitor setup. For simple, single-cable daisy chaining, these monitors are equipped with Future-Proof DisplayPort technology, in addition to HDMI ports. To ensure precise, uniform color, these monitors are factory calibrated to deliver an amazing Delta e<2 value. An integrated color uniformity function ensures consistent chromaticity across the screen, while a 14-bit 3D look-up table generates a stunningly smooth palette of 4.39 trillion colors. Add to that 6-axis color adjustment functionality, and this monitor provides the ultimate color processing capability for professional applications.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81SYbQ6PBuL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ViewSonic","source_asin":"B0C662M3GG","category_path":"Electronics"},"sku":"BM-1173300","productType":"Electronics","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C662M3GG","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"electronics-range.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C662M3GG","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1173301,"name":"DreamGear i.View A/V Pro Cable for iPod Video/Photo","category":"electronics","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41umbbB4VEL._AC_.jpg","description":"Product Description DreamGear i.View AV Cable Pro for iPod Video/Photo Amazon.com A handy accessory for iPod video and iPod photo owners, the i.View Pro cable lets you play your favorite videos through any TV or monitor with A/V inputs. Simply connect one end of the cable to your iPod's 3.5 mm headphone jack, and the other end to the RCA inputs on your TV or monitor. It's that simple, and thanks to the cable's advanced technology and gold-plated connectors, you'll enjoy high-quality resolution and a topnotch audio performance. In addition, you can use the cable to connect a traditional iPod to the left and right channels of a standard stereo receiver for music listening, or you can view JPEG photos from an iPod photo on the big screen. A must for anyone who wants to share their videos with friends, the i.View Pro cable and stand is backed by a 120-day warranty. What's in the Box i.View cable, user's manual.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41umbbB4VEL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"dreamGEAR","source_asin":"B000JCZL9E","category_path":"Electronics"},"sku":"BM-1173301","productType":"Electronics","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B000JCZL9E","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"electronics-range.jsonl","source_asin":"B000JCZL9E","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1173302,"name":"Toshiba SD-3900 Progressive-Scan DVD Player","category":"electronics","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31YKHPMRMPL._AC_.jpg","description":"Product Description This Toshiba DVD Progressive Scan Video Player delivers outstanding color, resolution and audio. Outputs are compatible with today's best analog and digital televisions. Features: ColorStream Pro Progressive Scan Video Outputs, 10-Bit/54mHz Video digital to analog conversion, 24-Bit/192kHz audio compatibility, DVD-Video/CD/Video CD playback, JPEG viewer, digital noise reduction, coaxial and optical TosLink digital audio output, black-level expansion, multiple picture settings, MP3 and WMA compatibility audio playback, dialogue enhancer, 16x power picture zoom and bookmarks. Amazon.com Get the most from DVDs and CDs with Toshiba's SD-3900 single-disc DVD player, whose ultimate progressive-scan ColorStream component-video outputs produce seamless, flicker-free images with high-definition and HD-ready TVs. Built-in MP3 and WMA (Windows Media Audio) decoding let you compile music on a PC and listen to it on a stereo or TV, and you can even watch customized digital-picture slideshows using recordable CDs filled with standard JPEG image files. Whether your living room is currently home to an HDTV or you're merely thinking of \"someday,\" the SD-3900 stands ready to deliver the full potential of DVDs. Progressive scanning, referred to as 480p for the number of horizontal lines that compose the video image, creates a picture using twice the scan lines of a conventional DVD picture, providing higher resolution and sharper images while eliminating nearly all motion artifacts. The SD-3900 also performs 3:2 pulldown. DVD mastering introduces a common distortion when adjusting 24 frames-per-second movies to 30 fps video; 3:2 pulldown digitally corrects this distortion. Conventional composite- and S-video outputs bring compatibility with nearly any television. The \"expanded\" mode in the player's black-level setting produces richer, deeper black tones in every image. PLUGE (Picture Line Up Generation Equipment) delivers black as well as below-black signals to a television. A set of left/right analog-audio outputs channel audio to Dolby Pro Logic receivers and stereo televisions. Both Dolby Digital and DTS 5.1-channel surround-sound signals can be routed through the player's digital-audio outputs (one each coaxial and optical) for direct connection to a full-featured audio/video receiver . The player's internal digital-to-analog converters work at 24-bit, 192 kHz resolution to ensure optimum sonic quality from a range of digital program material. Playback options include video 3D-DNR (digital noise reduction), powerful 16x picture zoom, dialogue enhancement, Spatializer simulated surround (for two-channel listening), and parental lock.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31YKHPMRMPL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Toshiba","source_asin":"B00008BO8Z","category_path":"Electronics"},"sku":"BM-1173302","productType":"Electronics","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00008BO8Z","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"electronics-range.jsonl","source_asin":"B00008BO8Z","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
