window.products.push({"id":1173364,"name":"LG 52LG50 52-Inch 1080p LCD HDTV","category":"electronics","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31mdyFWtRML._AC_.jpg","description":"Product Description 52\" LCD TV HD Montior, 1080p FULL HD (1920 x 1080) resolution, 15,000:1 Contrast Ratio, ATSC/NTSC/Clearn QAM - 1 Tuner, XD Engine, 178 True Wide Viewing Angle, SRS TruSurroundXT, 3 HDMI, USB 2.0, includes table stand From the Manufacturer Manufacturer's Description (February 20, 2009) When it comes to versatility, few HDTVs rival the LG50 series. The 52LG50 gives you a wide array of inputs and 52 inches of picture-perfect performance. Enjoy full 1080p HD resolution with three HDMI inputs, a 15,000:1 dynamic contrast ratio, LG's Invisible Speaker system and a whole lot more--all in a sleek, contoured design with chrome accents and a swivel stand. 52 inches of picture-perfect performance. Click to enlarge. Enjoy a wide array of inputs, including three HDMI. Click to enlarge or view side inputs. LG's Invisible Speaker system gives you a clean, polished look, and enhanced audio. HDMI delivers sharper, cleaner images and sounds without any data loss. Click to enlarge. Sleek design that looks great in any room. Click to enlarge. Remote included. Click to enlarge. Key Features: Full HD 1080p Resolution Full HD 1080p Resolution 15,000:1 Dynamic Contrast Ratio 15,000:1 Dynamic Contrast Ratio 3x HDMI V.1.3 with Deep Color 3x HDMI V.1.3 with Deep Color Intelligent Sensor Intelligent Sensor AV Mode (Cinema, Sports, Game) AV Mode (Cinema, Sports, Game) Clear Voice Clear Voice LG SimpLink Connectivity LG SimpLink Connectivity Invisible Speaker System Invisible Speaker System USB 2.0 (JPEG, MP3) USB 2.0 (JPEG, MP3) ISFccc ISFccc Full HD 1080p Resolution Displays HDTV programs in full 1920 x 1080p resolution for a more detailed picture. Intelligent Sensor Unlike other sensors which can only sense brightness of ambient light, LG's \"Intelligent Sensor\" uses 4,096 sensing steps to evaluate its surroundings. Using a sophisticated algorithm, the LG processes picture quality elements including brightness, contrast, color, sharpness and white balance. The result is a picture optimized for its surroundings, more pleasing to watch and which can also save up to 50% in power consumption. AV Mode The AV Mode optimizes the picture into Cinema, Sports, and game Mode according to the video and audio content. The viewer has the ability to quickly choose the correct mode for the picture they are viewing. Clear Voice Technology Automatically enhances and amplifies the sound of human voice frequency range to help keep dialogue audible when background noise swells. ISFccc This TV contains the detailed calibrations necessary for professional certification by the Imaging Science Foundation. The resulting ISF \"day\" and \"night\" modes will then be accessible by the user to experience the best their LG HDTV has to offer. Invisible Speaker System LG's 2008 line of TVs include a unique invisible speaker system, tuned by renowned audio expert, Mr. Mark Levinson. Speakers are embedded in strategic spots behind the front cabinet and use minute vibrations to turn the entire front bezel into the speaker system. The result is a clean, polished look, and enhanced audio by increasing the \"sweet spot,\" giving a wider and richer sound field. Expert Mode Sophisticated and detailed calibrations can be made through the easily accessible Expert Mode. (Up to 25 more fine adjustment points than typical TVs) This allows the user to optimize the picture quality, based on the viewing environment, lighting conditions or type of content. XD Engine LG's proprietary XD Engine technology takes low-resolution analog signals to near high-definition levels, providing better overall picture quality and an enhanced viewing experience. XD Engine encompasses six distinct processes that help to improve brightness, enhance detail, apply more accurate color and reduce noise, among other benefits. 24p Real Cinema Hi-def movies run at 24 frames per second, the speed that they were originally filmed in, making your home-cinema experience one step closer to a \"Real Cinema\" experience. 3D Digital Comb Filter 3D Digital Comb Filter makes images softer and cleaner. Unlike existing comb filters, the 3D Digital Comb Filter in LG LCD TVs separates signals for brightness and color with digital technology. This eliminates edge crawls and rainbow effects while extending the resolution, clearly separating color boundaries and making images softer and cleaner. EZ-Cable Management Easily manage your wiring, keeping things nice and tidy and avoiding a mess of audio and video cables. HDMI 1.3 with Deep Color HDMI delivers sharper, cleaner images and sounds without any data loss, making it suitable for graphic and multimedia users. HDMI 1.3 supports 30-bit, 36-bit and 48-bit (RGB or YCbCr) color depths. Previous versions of the HDMI specification only supported 24-bit color depth. Eliminates on-screen color banding, for smooth tonal transitions and subtle gradations between colors Eliminates on-screen color banding, for smooth tonal transitions and subtle gradations between colors E","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31mdyFWtRML._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"LG","source_asin":"B0016P2U4M","category_path":"Electronics"},"sku":"BM-1173364","productType":"Electronics","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0016P2U4M","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"electronics-range.jsonl","source_asin":"B0016P2U4M","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
