window.products.push({"id":1173425,"name":"Smart Watch for Women with Bluetooth Voice Call, Smartwatch IP67 Waterproof Fitness Watch for Android iOS with Whatsapp Message Notification/Sports Mo","category":"electronics","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/01RmK+J4pJL._AC_.gif","description":"⌚Fashion Bluetooth Smart Watch-- Women and men smart watches can answer/dial-up calls, equipped with 1.69'' full touch screen with 240*280 high definition resolution, bringing you a high definition visual experience. Update design watch strap, the buckle is more tighter and easily to wear. There are 100+ dials in the application, allow you change your favorite dial at any time. Custom watch face design, you can use your favorite picture as watch face, like your family or pet picture. (2 straps) 📞Bluetooth Voice Call & Messages Remind-- Smart watch use BLE5.0, more stable connection, you can avoid Bluetooth disconnect often and can't receive message. When receiving call, smartwatch will vibrate to remind you. You can answer or make a call directly on the watch. You can also close call function when don't need. The watch support information notification (SMS, WhatsApp, Facebook, etc.), you will not miss any important message. It is obsolutely the perfect smart assistant in your life. 🚴‍♂️8 Sports Fitness Tracker-- Smart Watch for men women offers 8 sports modes (walking, running, cycling, basketball, swimming, etc.). You can choose the corresponding mode according to your training. The fitness watch can accurately record the distance, steps, calories, exercise time, heart rate. It can help you perform scientific exercises and achieve fitness goals. This smart watch is absolutely the best choice for fitness enthusiasts, the best partner for outdoor sports. 💖All Day Health monitoring sports watches-- smart watches with text call, equiped high-performance sports optical sensors, can monitor heart rate for 24hours, and track your heart rate, blood pressure, blood oxygen, remind female menstrual cycle. It can also monitor and analyze your sleep quality, show deep sleep, light sleep and wake up time, help you understand your physical condition and make reasonable adjustments to make lifestyle healthier. (You can view more data on mobile applications.) 🔋IP67 Waterproof&Bluetooth Compatibility-- IP67 waterproof smartwatch support multiple languages and compatible with smartphone (iOS 8.4, Android 4.4 or above). Smartwatch equipped with battery of 200 Mah. Fully charging(1 hour) can provide 4-6 days of usage time, 30 days of standby time for watch. Get rid of the anxiety caused by constant charging and keep the energy flowing! (Note: Depending on personal usage) We provide sincere after-sale service at any time. If any problem please contact us","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/01RmK+J4pJL._AC_.gif","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"FEELNEVER","source_asin":"B0B641NGJG","category_path":"Electronics"},"sku":"BM-1173425","productType":"Electronics","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B641NGJG","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"electronics-range.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B641NGJG","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1173426,"name":"InFocus IN1102 Ultra Mobile Widescreen DLP Projector, 2.75 lbs, WXGA, 2200 Lumens","category":"electronics","retail price":118.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/3140epmj3WL._AC_.jpg","description":"From the Manufacturer The InFocus IN1102 is designed for teams that want it all - mobility, performance, and ease-of-use. With DisplayLink(TM) USB connectivity the IN1102 takes seconds to set up & project and uses a much smaller cable. Utilizing filter-free DLP(R) with BrilliantColor(TM) technology, the IN1102 brings superior visual performance to any meeting space. Ease-of-use At a mere 2.75 pounds (1.25 kg) and 2400cc, the lightweight & compact nature of the IN1102 makes it easy to move between floors and easy to travel with. With a much smaller footprint than a piece of notebook paper, every tabletop has room for this projector. Performance The IN1102 provides vivid colors and ample brightness. DLP® with BrilliantColor™ technology offers true-to-life color reproduction with 2200 lumens and an 1800:1 contrast ratio; a trifecta other mobile products cannot match. Leveraging high speed processing, the IN1102 accepts WUXGA & 1080p high resolution content. Additionally, the IN1102 offers WXGA native resolution to perfectly display from 16:10 widescreen computers. LiteTouch™ Keypad The sleek backlit LiteTouch™ control panel provides one-touch access to the most commonly used projector functions. DisplayLink™ Connectivity Hassle-free, lightning-fast projection. Wired and Wireless DisplayLink™ content over USB technology eliminates the need for bulky VGA cables and allows for computer and image set up in seconds. Optional Wireless DisplayLink™ adapters provide secure point-to-point transmissions up to 99mbps. No toggling or cumbersome function key combinations. DisplayLink™ makes projecting simple! LiteSwitch™ The InFocus LiteSwitch™ instant ON/OFF feature cuts \"cool down\" time and allows for faster transitions between meetings, enabling you to start up and shut down your projector in seconds. No more waiting. Just highly productive meetings with no time wasted in between. Peace of mind Plug-in, power-on, project. The IN1102 is the first projector to utilize DisplayLink™ technology to eliminate the need to resize computer screens or toggle function keys when setting up the InFocus IN1102. InFocus IN1102 features: WXGA 1200 x 800 Native Resolution WXGA 1200 x 800 Native Resolution 2200 ANSI Lumens (1650 lm Eco Mode) 2200 ANSI Lumens (1650 lm Eco Mode) 1800:1 Contrast Ratio 1800:1 Contrast Ratio 5 year parts, 2 year labor, 6 month lamp limited warranty 5 year parts, 2 year labor, 6 month lamp limited warranty What’s in the Box Power Cord, Navigator II Remote, USB (A to mini-B) cable, VGA Cable, Carry Case","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/3140epmj3WL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"InFocus","source_asin":"B001APXKLA","category_path":"Electronics"},"sku":"BM-1173426","productType":"Electronics","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B001APXKLA","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"electronics-range.jsonl","source_asin":"B001APXKLA","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
