window.products.push({"id":1173520,"name":"Premium Hands-Free Stereo Earphones 3.5MM Plug","category":"electronics","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/311U271HIwL._AC_.jpg","description":"The iLuv Premium Earphones With Speakez Remote feature a discrete microphone that lets you make hands-free calls, give voice commands to your device or make voice recordings. They have a built-in digital remote control that allows you to conveniently adjust the volume, control music playback or answer calls. The in-ear rubber pieces provide a comfortable and snug fit that reduces ambient noise, letting you focus on your music or phone conversation. The iLuv Earphones provide an easy way to manage hands-free conversations whenever the need arises, and its design ensures that you will have clear audio in most situations.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/311U271HIwL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"I LUV LTD","source_asin":"B004PEIGEO","category_path":"Electronics"},"sku":"BM-1173520","productType":"Electronics","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B004PEIGEO","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"electronics-range.jsonl","source_asin":"B004PEIGEO","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1173521,"name":"Alphacool 11286 Eisbaer 360 CPU - Black Water Cooling Kits, Systems and AIOs","category":"electronics","retail price":139.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61ynVUuR80L._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"With the “Eisbaer”, Alphacool is fundamentally revolutionizing the AIO cooler market. Where traditional AIO CPU-coolers are disposable products which are neither upgradeable nor refillable, the Alphacool “Eisbaer” is modularly built and can be upgraded, rebuilt or refilled at any time. This means that the “Eisbaer” is not only an AIO, but also fully built on classic water cooling components. That means it is quieter and more powerful than the average AIO solution.RadiatorAlphacool depends on a radiator made of pure copper. The base of the radiator is the popular Alphacool NexXxoS series, which is well-loved around the world. The pure copper construction raises the cooling performance enormously compared to the usual aluminium radiators used in classic AIOs. The slight thickness of the fins ensures enormous cooling power in fans with low rotational speed. This ensures that the performance of the “Eisbaer” when adjusting the fans down decreases much more slowly than in radiators with higher fin thickness.HosesThe flexible PVC hoses make installing the “Eisbaer” easy. These hoses are easier to arrange and move into the right position. So the hoses don’t bend and stop the flow of the water, both hoses have been fitted with anti-kink springs. The 11/8 mm size is also a standard in the water cooling field, alongside the 13/10 and 16/10.Quick-lock closureThe “Eisbaer” was designed with expandability directly in mind. This is why you’ll find a quick-lock closure on one of the hoses. This quick-lock mechanism is compatible with Alphacool HF quick-lock closures (1010383, 1010394, 1010395, 1010442), with which the circuit can easily be expanded to include anything from a radiator to a graphics card cooler. Furthermore, the “Eisbaer” is compatible with the upcoming Alphacool GPX-Pro graphics card AIO, which will use identical quick-lock closures.FansThe Eiswind fans were specially de","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61ynVUuR80L._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Alphacool","source_asin":"B01HQ6DCHI","category_path":"Electronics"},"sku":"BM-1173521","productType":"Electronics","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01HQ6DCHI","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"electronics-range.jsonl","source_asin":"B01HQ6DCHI","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
