window.products.push({"id":1173558,"name":"Tuff-Luv Oil Cloth 'Embrace Pro' case cover & Stand (with Sleep Function) for Apple iPad Mini - (Secret Garden) Black","category":"electronics","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71O3Gz7mv1L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"This bright yet simplistic floral Secret Garden oil cloth case can be a fantastic addition to your Apple iPad mini. When you're out and about, make sure your Apple iPad mini is the perfect accessory. We have such confidence in the quality of this beautifully designed case we offer a LIFETIME GUARANTEE.Our \"Embrace Pro\" design includes a kick-stands on the inside cover to hold your iPad mini in either portrait or landscape, which tucks discreetly into the soft interior cover. When you want to put it down, pull the leg out to stand your case up; when you're done, the subtle magnets will vanish it back into your case.You will find a recessed band allowing you to continue reading using just one hand, all the time keeping the controls perfectly in reach. Unlike other hand-held cases, which require you to stretch your hand over the back of the case, the Tuff-Luv Embrace Case supports a natural one-handed reading position, with easy access to page-turn controls on your device.Our high quality oil cloth book-style case includes a secure harness to ensure your new iPad mini stays where it belongs. You can have the peace of mind of knowing your tablet is safe, while keeping complete access to all the controls and functions you need to use your iPad mini. Bumpy commute? Simply slip a finger through the hole in the strap for additional grip.You can enjoy a cup of tea or coffee while reading, and never have to set it down to turn the page! The hand-band is aligned perfectly to keep you in reach of the controls, while maintaining a comfortable position.Simple and tough to protect against all the bumps and scratches that the world has to offer. On the inside you will find a fine micro-fibre interior lining to give your iPad mini that extra care and attention it deserves.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71O3Gz7mv1L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"TUFF LUV","source_asin":"B009W5B6SO","category_path":"Electronics"},"sku":"BM-1173558","productType":"Electronics","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B009W5B6SO","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"electronics-range.jsonl","source_asin":"B009W5B6SO","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
