window.products.push({"id":1173703,"name":"TNP AC Power Cable Computer Monitor Cord 1 Feet 10a 125v 3 Prong TV Plug-in Cord NEMA 5-15P to IEC 320 C13 Replacement Wire for Dell AOC Asus Lenovo D","category":"electronics","retail price":9.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/5124bhhsaaL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"NEMA connectors are power plugs and receptacles used for AC mains electricity in North America and other countries that use the standards set by the US National Electrical Manufacturers Association. A power cord, line cord, or mains cable is a cable that connects an appliance to the mains electricity supply via a wall socket or extension cord. NEMA 5 (three-prong, with safety ground pin) connectors are used for commonplace domestic electrical equipment and other heavy duty or special purposes. NEMA 5 devices are three-wire grounding devices (hot-neutral-ground) rated for 125 V maximum, with the 5-15, 5-20 and 5-30 being grounded versions of the 1-15, 1-20 and 1-30, respectively.This universal power cord is designed to work with most PCs, monitors, scanners, printers and other devices and peripherals that have a removable power cord and use the 3-pin shroud power connector. All of our power cables feature fully molded design that provides maximum durability and long lasting life. Specification: Color: Black Color: Black Cable Type: Power cable 18AWG Cable Type: Power cable 18AWG Cable Length: 1 Feet Cable Length: 1 Feet Left Connector Type: IEC 60320-C13 (Female) Left Connector Type: IEC 60320-C13 (Female) Right Connector Type: Power NEMA 5-15P (Male) Right Connector Type: Power NEMA 5-15P (Male) *Check the voltage and amp rating of your equipment to ensure compatibility *Check the voltage and amp rating of your equipment to ensure compatibility Compatibility: Will fit TVs, Monitors, Game Consoles, Printers, Sports Equipment, and other appliances with a similar plug including Samsung Toshiba LG Sharp Sony Sceptre RCA Panasonic Philips Mitsubishi Magnavox TV LCD Plasma DLP, Acer Asus HP Samsung ViewSonic Dell Compaq Hanns-G LG Planar Monitor, Screen, PS3, XBOX 360, Acer Asrock Epson Compatibility: Will fit TVs, Monitors, Game Consoles, Printers, Sports Equipment, and other appliances with a similar plug including Samsung Toshiba LG Sharp Sony Sceptre RCA Panasonic Philips Mitsubishi Magnavox TV LCD Plasma DLP, Acer Asus HP Samsung ViewSonic Dell Compaq Hanns-G LG Planar Monitor, Screen, PS3, XBOX 360, Acer Asrock Epson Package Content: 1x Universal Power Cord 1 Feet - NEMA 5-15P to IEC320C13 Power Cable Wire Connector Socket Plug Jack - Black, 2 Pack 1x Universal Power Cord 1 Feet - NEMA 5-15P to IEC320C13 Power Cable Wire Connector Socket Plug Jack - Black, 2 Pack","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/5124bhhsaaL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"TNP Products","source_asin":"B09V4T218C","category_path":"Electronics"},"sku":"BM-1173703","productType":"Electronics","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09V4T218C","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"electronics-range.jsonl","source_asin":"B09V4T218C","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
