window.products.push({"id":1173710,"name":"Remote Case for Apple Tv 4th 5th Generation, Akwox Apple TV Siri Remote Cover Case with Lanyard (Purple) -not for New Apple 4k TV Series 6th Gen 2021","category":"electronics","retail price":5.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71WLRqsQXML._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Why Akwox: Akwox company is always committing to provide people inspired products.Our designers adhere to provide consumers' with stylish and practical products, at the same time with top quality.We are aimed to : Meet consumer demand and provide satisfied service! Akwox Specially Designed Case The silicon cover case was designed to provide maximum protection for your Apple Tv 4 Remote. Durable silicone feels soft to the touch and adds great grip to allow for added security and comfortability when using the remote. All functions, ports, and devices are easily accessible with the case on.  It also could protect Remote Controller Cover Skin from scratches, dust, and damage.Keep it looking brand new. Inside the box 1 x silicone case 1 x handle strap","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71WLRqsQXML._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"AKWOX","source_asin":"B07DBYS7DG","category_path":"Electronics"},"sku":"BM-1173710","productType":"Electronics","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07DBYS7DG","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"electronics-range.jsonl","source_asin":"B07DBYS7DG","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1173711,"name":"Slik Pro Trigger Release Ball Head for Digital SLR Cameras","category":"electronics","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/713jFWPwSCL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The world's original, and most popular trigger-style ball head, so revolutionary it had to be patented. The SLIK AF 2100 trigger design ball head can take ease of photographing on a tripod to a new level. The key is in the trigger handle. It has an over sized trigger release that you squeeze to release and freely move the head. When you have moved your camera to the desired position, just release the trigger and the ball head locks firmly into place, at any angle. This smooth and natural movement makes the ball head feel like more on an extension of our hand than any other ball head available. The AF 2100 handle is large enough for photographers with large hands to have a solid grip, but sized so that photographers with smaller hands will be able to use it with comfort and ease. If fact, many people have chosen the AF 2100 over other trigger designs for just that reason. Capable of handling more than 10 pounds of equipment, the AF 2100 can, for example, support a 300 mm f/2.8 lens with a heavy professional camera body. A convenient thumb switch on the handle locks and unlocks the quick release shoe, which means that circular quick release plate can rotate over 320 degrees and be locked at any point. There is also a separate safety release button so that the quick release plate can only be removed from the head when it is pressed. Your camera is securely attached to the AF 2100 until you decide to remove it.  MAX. OPERATING HEIGHT 6 IN WEIGHT 1.9 LBS MAX. LOAD 11 LBS PLATFORM 55 TRIPOD MOUNT THREAD U3/8 AND U1/4-20","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/713jFWPwSCL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"SLIK","source_asin":"B073XLLY98","category_path":"Electronics"},"sku":"BM-1173711","productType":"Electronics","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B073XLLY98","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"electronics-range.jsonl","source_asin":"B073XLLY98","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1173712,"name":"Incipio NX-111 f8 Hi-Fi Stereo Earbuds - Retail Packaging - White","category":"electronics","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31lcN5gwNdL._AC_.jpg","description":"f08 ear buds bring excellent sound quality along with a variety of fun colors to choose from. The colorful selection is perfect for those seeking to add a pop of personality to their audio experience!f08 ear buds bring excellent sound quality along with a variety of fun colors to choose from. The colorful selection is perfect for those seeking to add a pop of personality to their audio experience! Headquartered in Irvine, CA, Incipio has people in London, Hong Kong, and India, allowing them to reach their customers and work on projects 24/7. Their dedicated staff does just that. At 140 strong, Incipio's team includes some of the most talented industrial and graphic designers, mechanical engineers, customer satisfaction fanatics and software developers around, all led by a world-class management team.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31lcN5gwNdL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Incipio","source_asin":"B008FY3988","category_path":"Electronics"},"sku":"BM-1173712","productType":"Electronics","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B008FY3988","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"electronics-range.jsonl","source_asin":"B008FY3988","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1173713,"name":"NECESPOW Bluetooth 5.0 FM Transmitter for Car, 48W USB-C PD + QC3.0 Dual USB Ports Fast Charging, Support AUX/TF Card/U-Disk, Bluetooth Car Adapter MP","category":"electronics","retail price":24.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/615q9OFncBL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"🚗【Dual Fast car Charge 48W(PD+QC3.0)】Bluetooth FM transmitter supports quick charging of two devices simultaneously. Type-C port with up to 30W power delivery efficiently charges compatible devices faster; USB-A port with Quick Charge 3.0 18W charges compatible devices up to 4 times faster than conventional charging. This multiprotocol supports like QC3.0, PD3.0, QC2.0, Samsung AFC, OnePlus Dash, OPPO VOOC, HUAWEI, Sam sung, etc. 🚙【Upgraded Version Include AUX Cable】The USB-A (QC 3.0 interface) plug orientation is bidirectional, which data can pass in either direction. The design allows USB devices to just work when you plug them in, be connected and disconnected at will. That’s the beauty and simplicity of USB. Apart from that, NECESPOW provides AUX cable for customers. The connection via the AUX cable offers better sound quality than via the FM transmission. 🚕【All in One Button】One button operation enable you seamlessly switch between incoming calls and music. Through press and hold, knob button can achieve mode switching. To change FM frequency/adjust voice volume/answer/reject/hand up/recall is so easy. And long press for 5 seconds to turn it off. 🚐 【Get Your Music Ready】Auto bluetooth adapter can play music from smartphones via bluetooth and it is designed with AUX output, U-disk port and SD/TF card slot. With 3.5 mm audio cable, it easily transfers music from device to car audio. Once you insert U-disk/ TF/ Micro SD card into the auto adapter, “DJ” will drop the beat! Music of MP3/ WMA/ WAV/ APE/ FLAC format will be play immediately without any problem. The auto adapter can read U-disk and TF/ Micro SD card up to 64GB. 🚛【Multi-Safety Protection】FM transmitter bluetooth for car comes with built-in over-current protection, over-voltage protection, intelligent temperature control and short circuit protection. Its low noise and low ripple output, which can effectively reduce the loss of electronic devices within the charging device. It effectively prevents multiple problems, protects your loved car and smart devices.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/615q9OFncBL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"NECESPOW","source_asin":"B0BHW77SMD","category_path":"Electronics"},"sku":"BM-1173713","productType":"Electronics","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BHW77SMD","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"electronics-range.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BHW77SMD","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
