window.products.push({"id":1173953,"name":"Green Onions Supply AG+ Anti-Glare Screen Protector for 9.7-Inch Trio Stealth Pro Tablet (RT-SPTSP9702HD)","category":"electronics","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61jjdqzX7TL._AC_SL1150_.jpg","description":"This is the AG+ Anti-Glare Screen Protector for Trio Stealth Pro 9.7\". This enhanced anti-glare coating is the ultimate matte finish for Screen Protectors from Green Onions Supply. The new AG+ anti-glare coating uses specially designed matte patterning. The end result is a considerably greater amount of light-scattering and reflection blurring, which makes focusing on your screen considerably easier. AG+ achieves this while actually providing superior clarity to matte films that aren't even as effective as AG+. This breaks the equation of anti-glare films, because you don't have to trade better glare-reduction for more clarity or vice versa: AG+ provides the best of both. This clarity advantage is even more emphasized on tablet screens, like the new iPad mini. The Protector uses silicone glue for a secure, residue free attachment, and it can be easily removed and reapplied if necessary. Besides the screen protector, we have also included a high-quality micro-fiber cleaning cloth and a dust isolation sheet to help prepare your screen for installation. You can use our in-depth video tutorial to walk you through installation and trouble-shooting. The Screen Protector is very slim, so it is fully compatible with the capacitive touch-screen and many cases and accessories for the Trio Stealth Pro 9.7\".","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61jjdqzX7TL._AC_SL1150_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Green Onions Supply","source_asin":"B00CWZH8Z6","category_path":"Electronics"},"sku":"BM-1173953","productType":"Electronics","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00CWZH8Z6","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"electronics-range.jsonl","source_asin":"B00CWZH8Z6","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1173954,"name":"BlueParrott C300-XT Wireless Headset with Bonus Protective Carrying Case","category":"electronics","retail price":139.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/5119u6MtFkL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"The BlueParrott C300-XT Wireless Headset is engineered for wireless calls and music and offers clarity of sound, in a busy environment with a high level of disruptive noise. It delivers Noise Cancellation of about 80% ensuring you can focus on your calls without any distraction. This compact headset features a Push-to-talk Parrott Button™ that allows you to operate your headset hands-free, helping you handle multiple tasks with ease. With this button, you can also customize your one-touch-access to get quick access for your most used features. The headset also features Bluethoth 5.0 connectivity allowing you to easily connect to your device. The headset gives a battery backup of 10 hours in a single charge to keep going for long periods throughout the day. This headset uses USB-B cable for charging and requires 3 hours for full charging.The BlueParrott Protective Carrying Case is a protective storage for the BlueParrott Noise Canceling Bluetooth Headset. The Engineered EVA hard shell and soft interior layer protect against scratches, drops, impacts and crushes. It fits to BlueParrot Models easily. C300-XT Wireless Headset Features: Range: 300 FeetSpeaker Frequency Range: 20Hz~20KHzBluetooth 5.0 Connectivity80% Noise CancellationCustomizable Parrott ButtonMicrophone Frequency Range: 150-6800 HzAdvanced Audio Distribution (A2DP) Profile for Streaming For Music,GPS Streaming, & Voice DialingConnects Upto 8 Devices at a TimeVoiceControl For Hands-Free Answering or Ignoring CallsUp to 10 Hours Talktime Time3 Hours Charging TimeLED Indicator for PowerMultiple Wearing Style Protective Carrying Case Features: Protective StorageEngineered EVA Hard ShellProtect Against Scratches, Drops, Impacts & Crushes","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/5119u6MtFkL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"BlueParrott","source_asin":"B07N49BBH7","category_path":"Electronics"},"sku":"BM-1173954","productType":"Electronics","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07N49BBH7","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"electronics-range.jsonl","source_asin":"B07N49BBH7","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
